        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX CD110B, Single Cylinder 2-1/2\" Diameter Stainless Steel Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nINOX's Stainless Steel 2-1/2 Round Deadbolt is a smaller profile deadbolt that is great for use on residential and light duty commercial applications. It has a 2-1/2 inch diameter rose, ideal for modern settings. The 2-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Door Lock is a single cylinder deadbolt, meaning it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. It will fit doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches thick. The outside and the inside escutcheons are made out of wrought stainless steel. The Round Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt is available in polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze stainless steel finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Round Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C, 5-pin</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Concealed M5 thru-bolt installation.</li>\r\n<li>For residential or light-duty commercial applications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the INOX CD110B 2-1/2\" Diameter Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Wrought Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Width: 23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt\" 1\" throw</i>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-CD110B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262377\"><b>INOX CD110B Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt,",
                "description": "INOX's Stainless Steel 2-1/2 Round Deadbolt is a smaller profile deadbolt that is great for use on residential and light duty commercial applications. It has a 2-1/2 inch diameter rose, ideal for modern settings. The 2-1/2 Inch Stainless Steel Door Lock is a single cylinder deadbolt, meaning it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. It will fit doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches thick. The outside and the inside escutcheons are made out of wrought stainless steel. The Round Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt is available in polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze stainless steel finishes.\r\n",
